Shows handles, real-names (if NOT private), and organization strings.

Runs from the CLI, or online.

===================================================================

Pick installation method #1 or #2.  (You do NOT need to do both.)

Installation Method #1:   (Allows for real-time computing, but is slow.)
   A) Edit the variables below marked as "SysOp Variables".

   B) Copy Orgz.rexx TO CNet:Rexx/Orgz.rexx

   C) Edit your CNet:BBSmenu file.
      Onto the END of the list marked "2; Available everywhere",
      add the following line...
      > ORGanizations, ORGz | #4 rx CNet:Rexx/Orgz.rexx MIN=1 SORT=6}


Installation Method #2:    (Allows for very fast, online execution.)
   A) Edit the variables below marked as "SysOp Variables".

   B) Copy Orgz.rexx TO CNet:Rexx/Orgz.rexx

   C) Edit your CNet:BBSmenu file.
      Onto the END of the list marked "2; Available everywhere",
      add the following line...
      > ORGanizations, ORGz | {*1 SysText:Orgz.txt}

   D) Set-up a nightly CNet event as:
      Ports   : 0
      Weekdays: SMTWRFS
      Time    : 100
      Valid   : 1
      Interval: 0
      Iterate : 1
      Type    : Immediate--system idle or not
      Command : DOS-CMD
      Args    : rx CNet:Rexx/Orgz.rexx >SysText:Orgz.txt MIN=1 SORT=6

===================================================================

Orgz.rexx allows any of the following options, in any order.
      MIN=n     : Start at acct #n.  (Use MIN=2 if you wish to skip SysOp acct #1)
                  ("MIN=?" will prompt user for acct #)
      MAX=n     : End at acct #n.
                  ("MAX=?" will prompt user for acct #)
      NOHANDLES : Do NOT show handles.
      PRIVATE   : Show real-names, even if 'private'.
      SMART     : If real-name is 'public', show it.  Otherwise, show handle.
      ALL       : List all users (even those w/o organization)
      SORT=6    : Sort the output by handle.
      SORT=26   : Sort the output by real-name.
      SORT=49   : Sort the output by organization.
      SORT=7    : Sort the output by name. (If using NOHANDLES or SMART option)
      SORT=30   : Sort the output by organization. (If using NOHANDLES or SMART)
      HELP      : Display this help-text.

(No one other than the SysOp should ever view a list using the "PRIVATE" option.)

